      h1 Miso Tracker privacy policy
      p Effective date: February 25, 2026
      p Miso Tracker is a life tracking app for Magic: The Gathering. It is designed to work entirely offline and does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data.
      h2 Data collection
      p Miso Tracker does not collect any personal information. The app does not use analytics, advertising, crash reporting, or any other third-party services.
      h2 Data storage
      p All app data (such as life totals, player count, and preferences) is stored locally on your device. This data never leaves your device and is not accessible to the developer or any third party.
      h2 Data sharing
      p Miso Tracker does not share any data with anyone, for any purpose.
      h2 Changes to this policy
      p If this policy is updated, the revised version will be posted at this same URL with an updated effective date.
      h2 Contact
      p If you have questions about this privacy policy, you can contact hello@misotracker.com
